    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "After Lyova finds nothing in Senya's pockets and walks away, Fedya demands to know where the meat went. Senya proudly reveals his secret contraptions. Listen to the full conversation in Russian first, and then we will walk through every line together.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "anya",
      "t": "Может, ещё и штаны снять?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
